cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived tables, please cite this archive. The article citation will be added here once the article is published."
title: "Analysis code for: Apparent transcriptional signatures of arteriovenous fistula maturation failure are dominated by cell composition"
abstract: >-
  Pre-specified reanalysis of public human arteriovenous fistula single-cell RNA-sequencing
  data (GSE305423) that separates the effect of cell composition from cell-intrinsic
  transcriptional change, with power analysis, threshold sensitivity, and a bulk-cohort
  signature check (GSE220796).
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hu9872/avf-composition-intrinsic"
url: "https://github.com/hu9872/avf-composition-intrinsic"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
keywords:
  - arteriovenous fistula
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - cell composition
  - reproducibility
  - negative results
